{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Microchip</strong> is a thrilling multiplayer game that combines survival, strategy, and social deduction. Players are trapped in an isolated, abandoned forest under heavy radiation, where they must join one of two factions: Infected or Survivor. To survive, they need to collect items, complete objectives, follow clues, and make strategic decisions\u2014but trust is a dangerous thing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A biotech company claimed to have developed a serum that grants immunity to radiation. To test it, seven volunteers were sent into an abandoned, irradiated forest. At first, everything seemed normal, but within days, strange things started happening. Some test subjects began to undergo uncontrollable mutations. Their instincts became feral, their strength grew, and they were no longer fully human. These individuals were soon labeled Infected. The remaining subjects, who resisted the serum's effects, became the Survivors. But now, they face a far greater challenge\u2014staying alive in the forest, avoiding radiation, and escaping the relentless hunt of the Infected. Who is Infected, and who is a Survivor? Paranoia spreads, time is running out, and every second, survival gets harder... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The real threat? Is it the Infected hunting you down? Or the Survivor you trust the most?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526550/extras/8cbd8c5eefaa0cfe8dd46b352bfa06b9.poster.avif?t=1760828225\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526550/extras/8cbd8c5eefaa0cfe8dd46b352b